<title>ROMANIA: Romania inflation seen up at 97 pct in 1997- govt.</title>
<headline>Romania inflation seen up at 97 pct in 1997- govt.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania expects year-on-year inflation to quicken to 97 percent this year from 56.9 percent in 1996, a government official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The forecast for inflation was used to calculate the government offer for the wage indexation this year, which would cover around 75 percent of the expected price rises&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
